{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Embark on an enchanting journey through the vibrant, mystical world of Zulu legend in Tower of Wishes: Shaka</i></strong>, a captivating match-3 adventure that blends rich storytelling with engaging puzzle gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom of Ilanga faces its darkest hour. Invaders with fire-breathing weapons threaten your borders, an unnatural drought withers your crops, and the amadlozi keep demanding ever increasing sacrifices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The situation is grim and there is but one hope: <strong><i>The Tower of Wishes, an ancient monument that appears only when the moon swallows the sun.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the noble king Vusumuzi, ascend the tower, solving puzzles, matching beads and overcoming challenges to save your people from famine, invaders, and the wrath of the ancestral spirits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun match-3 puzzles that test your wit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-Games Galore: Play mini-games that offer different challenges, from hidden objects to jigsaw puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysteries of the Tower as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >African themed art that brings the Tower of Wishes to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a wish that will shape the future of your kingdom and its people.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Journey Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644870/b33254dba191d2cc01c0c84b8cf0c2cdfb703deb.jpg"},{"name":"Blast Fingers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644870/7690fcc785d0a3b311fa5ef4773c61c9007627f3.jpg"},{"name":"Learning The Ropes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644870/408330ee5ce86dad13ae200a19f74b600b7b0275.jpg"},{"name":"7 In One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644870/17f2ffa1f152b40641fbc5c565194b46a501d3ee.jpg"},{"name":"Well Begun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644870/d48ceb4acafe23c44c0e4f0101ea6a0bc7e0de7b.jpg"},{"name":"Scoricidal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644870/38f57c36e0031aadf1889827f362096b35a68b00.jpg"},{"name":"Ten Marks The Spot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644870/4a32cfb8201ba15ea2c81ef7ac56254bec3d4d7a.jpg"},{"name":"Half Way Mark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644870/d7c529494310324b6a9f42ab26a0ce3f5fc32af1.jpg"},{"name":"Master Blaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644870/adcf78a6c61d5f69c09cfe428b75a1955eb66605.jpg"},{"name":"The Second Coming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3644870/dbbac7dbb037af649d00b59b5cec494058c0be2f.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644870?t=1746427146","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644870/009d799c805ef95ae7b32cb504bf56dd630d625f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746427146","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644870/4ceb68e1363f037fa0c5e8167c4beddbddbd9041/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746427146","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644870/4ceb68e1363f037fa0c5e8167c4beddbddbd9041/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746427146","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><